  "headline": "Jujutsu Kaisen season 3 inserts a Feb. 19 recap before episode 8",
  "description": "Jujutsu Kaisen season 3 will air a special recap on February 19, 2026, with episode 8 returning on February 26. The mid-season pause sets the stage for the run to the March 26 finale.",
  "articleBody": "Jujutsu Kaisen season 3 will take a one-week detour with a special recap airing on February 19, 2026. Reports say the recap includes new narration and revisits key beats from the Shibuya Incident through the Culling Game setup.\n\nEpisode 8 is set to return on February 26, keeping the series on track for a March 26 finale if weekly broadcasts continue. The recap is positioned as a mid-season reset to reframe the story before the climax.\n\nSeason 3 opened on January 8 with a double-episode premiere, and international streaming began the same day on Crunchyroll. With the Culling Game arc now in full swing, the recap offers viewers a structured on-ramp for the upcoming stretch.",
